  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "RichTextKit 0.6.171\n\nBug fixes:\n- MeasuredOverhang measured the wrong glyphs after composed characters or ligatures\n- StyleManager could lose an inherited font width\n- HitTestLine threw if called before layout\n- Buffers reallocated on every grow instead of doubling\n- ResetPooledMemory stopped pooled objects being reset\n\nPerformance:\n- Much less memory allocated during layout, and none during paint\n- Fonts used for font fallback are now disposed\n\nOther:\n- Removed the unneeded System.ValueTuple dependency\n- The package now includes the readme and these release notes\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/toptensoftware/RichTextKit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
